    "# Task 3 - Model Explainability with SHAP\n",
    "### What is SHAP?\n",
    "SHAP tells us WHY the model made each prediction.\n",
    "For example: \"This transaction was flagged as fraud BECAUSE\n",
    "the signup-to-purchase time was very short AND the purchase\n",
    "value was unusually high\"\n",
